NOTE ON DATA

This license covers the source code in this repository only. It does not cover
the datasets the pipeline consumes, which carry their own terms:

  FNSPID (Financial News and Stock Price Integration Dataset) is licensed
  CC BY-NC-4.0 -- non-commercial use with attribution. See the README for the
  citation. No FNSPID data is redistributed in this repository.

  Market data is retrieved from Yahoo Finance via yfinance, and headlines from
  Yahoo Finance RSS, each subject to the provider's own terms of use.

  Sentiment scoring uses ProsusAI/finbert, distributed under its own license.

The database file this pipeline builds is not version controlled and is not
distributed here.
